"the": {"0": "the", "1": "the"}}, {"urgent": {"00": "pressing", "01": "immediate", "10": "critical", "11": "compelling"}}, {"need": {"00": "requirement", "01": "necessity", "10": "demand", "11": "obligation"}}, {"for": {"0": "for the purpose of", "1": "in order to"}}, {"reconciliation": {"00": "harmonization", "01": "settlement", "10": "resolution", "11": "rapprochement"}}, {"and": {"0": "and", "1": "and"}}, {"restitution": {"00": "compensation", "01": "repayment", "10": "reimbursement", "11": "redress"}}], "container": "Colonialism had a profound impact on indigenous peoples, causing irreparable damage to their communities and cultures. The arrival of colonizers led to the displacement and marginalization of indigenous populations, as their lands were seized and their way of life was disrupted. Resources were extracted without regard for the well-being of the native inhabitants, leading to economic exploitation and poverty. Additionally, colonial powers imposed their own languages, religions, and values on indigenous peoples, eroding their cultural identity. These long-lasting effects continue to shape the lives of indigenous communities today, highlighting the urgent need for reconciliation and restitution.", "encoded_message": "Imperialism experienced one deep consequence regarding native natives, triggering incalculable harm towards its groups plus lifestyles. That coming belonging to conquerors resulted in to the relocation and exclusion of indigenous inhabitants, because their territories were existing as confiscated and their style of existence was shattered. Assets were mined lacking attention for the safety of the indigenous dwellers, causing to economic exploitation and poverty. Additionally, colonial powers imposed their own languages, religions, and values on indigenous peoples, eroding their cultural identity. These long-lasting effects continue to shape the lives of indigenous communities today, highlighting the urgent need for reconciliation and restitution.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 3.65, "secret_key_generation": 83.69}, "decoding_time": 0.00031304359436035156, "decoded_message": "0100010100101110000001001100001000100110001011011100110111010101", "error_message": ""}